        "what": "D569 ESTIMATED 2026-11-01 (aim agent B): no turn rate, curve or zone for Destiny 2 is published anywhere; every number below is an estimate to be replaced by Calibrate (docs/AIM-PRESETS-2026-11-01-B.md)."
