      {
        "what": "No dead-zone, curve or acceleration option exists in the game (Medium: players keep asking, no patch note adds one).",
        "url": "https://steamcommunity.com/app/1085660/discussions/3/2514645967863187874"
      },
      {
        "what": "Dead zone 0.20 round and curve x^2.8: ESTIMATED from GIMX's open PS4 Destiny 1 calibration (dead zone 28-29/127, compensation exponent 0.35), same studio and engine family (Low for Destiny 2).",
        "url": "https://github.com/matlo/GIMX-configurations"
      },
      {
        "what": "Turn speed ESTIMATED: hip 300 deg/s base at Look Sensitivity 20, about 450 once the rim ramp has run (gain 1.5 after 0.4 s above 95 % stick). Players report the camera \"slowly accelerating\" at full stick, with no numbers (Low); 20 read as about twice the old cap 10. Pitch 0.65 x yaw and aiming 0.55 x hip at ADS modifier 1.0 are Bungie-family guesses; a scope's own zoom slows aiming further.",
